qualifications.raw:
{{Illusionnotes
| name = Counterspell
| desc = Does not benefit from the passive bonus {{M|magic resistance}} component.
}}

 {{Spellblockcard}}

{{Spellreflectcard}}

* Interrupts Anti-Mage's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.

* Stacks multiplicatively with other {{M|magic resistance}} sources.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* Procs the {{M|Spell Block}} component.
*# {{Symbol|bonus shd}} Creates an Counterspell-based {{M|illusion}} per {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted ability {{M|Spell Block|text=blocked}} with its notes apply.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Procs the {{M|Spell Reflection}} component, with the following properties:
*#** Does not stack with {{A|Grimstroke|Soulbind}}.
*#** Does not reflect the following abilities:
*#*** {{A|Phantom Assassin|Phantom Strike}}
*#*** {{A|Riki|Blink Strike}}
<hr>
{{Illucraft|name=Anti-Mage Counterspell}}

* {{cf|shdnotes}} 
** The created illusion simultaneously casts {{A|Anti-Mage|Counterspell}} with Anti-Mage.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Counterspell icon0}}
| desc = Passively grants magic resistance. Counterspell may be activated to create an anti-magic shell around Anti-Mage that blocks and reflects any targeted spells.
}}
<hr>
* {{Symbol|a|Up}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} 
** Has {{Code|{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1-v1)|v1={{#var:Counterspell type1 value1}}|%}} + {{calc|(1-v1)*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}|v1={{#var:Counterspell type1 value1}}|%}} × Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]}} {{M|magic resistance}} per stack.

* The {{Code|modifier_item_lotus_orb_channel_check}} prevents the following abilities from utilizing {{M|Spell Reflection}} sources:
** {{A|Phantom Assassin|Phantom Strike}}
** {{A|Riki|Blink Strike}}
** {{A|Terrorblade|Conjure Image}}
** {{A|Void Spirit|Astral Step}}
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} The created [[illusion]] has the following distances apart to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy's correspondingly to the caster's {{M|collision size}}:
{{Colsizecard}}

{{Splblocknotes
| name = Mana Void
| desc = Does not proc [[Spell Block]] sources on secondary targets.
}}

